{"id":"vod_md_5911","vodId":"5911","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"恋如雨止","name_cn":"恋如雨止","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231014-1/d308d34845e30296f299b01821ef8a22.jpg"},"summary":"橘晶（渡部纱弓 配音）拥有着一副冷淡的外表，内心里却是和外表极不相称的天真和单纯。橘曾经是学校田径队的种子选手，却因为种种意外而选择了退出。之后，橘来到了名为“GARDEN”的家庭餐馆打工，餐馆的老板是一个名叫近藤正己（平田广明 配音）的男人，他离过一次婚并且有一个孩子。看上去邋里邋遢对什么都不在乎的近藤意外的吸引了橘的注意，渐渐的，橘无可救药的喜欢上了这个年长她28岁的男人。当这份炙热的感情再也无法隐藏之时，橘对近藤表白了，然而，换来的却是对方的拒绝。但橘并没有气馁，她选择以朋友的身份留在近藤的身边，怀揣着小小的期待，期待她如同雨季一样悠长的单恋能够迎来小小的晴天。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-14 08:02:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/bDIU7bcs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/UrGqZLD3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/3VWVkHK7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/zh8YaZmK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/iET3prsA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/9tWXS59N/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/cjdtwcma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/xjkDU2ES/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/ISWesTqW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/bpmo1iAU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/CthKNLvm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/B4xA1CCR/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:51.310Z"}